scope one grant taken -- a rota seat changed by fit and measurement, with the displaced page left whole
status GREEN on this lap's own work -- rota_grid green, tracked links ok, the seated page grades 93 at Door. AMBER on the tree: reds_ledger_monotone stands RED at numbers_double_bound=3 against a ceiling of 1, a fault no lap may repair and left standing for Keaton's word
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- %530, %592 and %512 are each one number over two published incidents; the ledger guard is red fleet-wide until a word says which renumbers, and no lap may move a published row.
